@startuml
title 采集任务状态模型 M7-ST-01
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateFontName Microsoft YaHei
state "待执行\nPENDING" as PENDING
state "运行中\nRUNNING" as RUNNING
state "成功\nSUCCEEDED" as SUCCEEDED
state "失败\nFAILED" as FAILED
state "重试等待\nRETRY_WAIT" as RETRY_WAIT
state "安全停止中\nSTOPPING" as STOPPING
state "已停止\nSTOPPED" as STOPPED
[*] --> PENDING
PENDING --> RUNNING : T01 start\n[权限与来源条件有效]
PENDING --> STOPPED : T02 stop\n[管理员请求有效]
RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : T03 complete\n[版本对账和发布成功]
RUNNING --> RETRY_WAIT : T04 transient_failure\n[临时故障或429且仍有重试预算]
RUNNING --> FAILED : T05 access_denied\n[401/403/明确412拒绝或验证码或许可拒绝]
RUNNING --> FAILED : T06 fatal_failure\n[不可恢复错误或重试预算耗尽]
RUNNING --> STOPPING : T07 stop\n[管理员请求获准且尚未发布完成]
STOPPING --> STOPPED : T08 stop_settled\n[安全边界已到且未提交写入已撤销]
RETRY_WAIT --> RUNNING : T09 retry_due\n[等待已到期且预算权限有效]
RETRY_WAIT --> FAILED : T10 retry_exhausted\n[预算不足或人工终止等待]
RETRY_WAIT --> STOPPED : T11 stop\n[管理员请求有效]
FAILED --> PENDING : T12 manual_retry\n[管理员显式重试且条件已修复 新attempt]
note bottom of RUNNING
仅处理与发布确认完成后成功
stop优先获准时不再发布
end note
note bottom of FAILED
manual_retry创建新attempt
保留旧尝试记录
end note
@enduml
